# ── Large vendor SDKs (download separately — see README) ────────────────
# Couchbase Lite Enterprise xcframeworks: ~300 MB, and their dSYMs exceed
# GitHub's file-size limits.
FieldCopilot/couchbase-lite-swift_xc_enterprise_4/
FieldCopilot/couchbase-lite-vector-search_xcframework_2/

# ── Bundled embedding model (1.1 GB — far over GitHub's 100 MB limit) ───
# Exported separately; see README for how to obtain or re-export it.
FieldCopilot/Qwen3Embedding/*.aimodel/
FieldCopilot/Qwen3Embedding/*.aimodelc/

